## Input

```css
$unit:px;
.incomplete-variable {
  width:attr(data-width $,10px);
  color:red;
}
.after-variable{display:block}
.empty-interpolation {
  width:attr(data-width #{},10px);
  color:green;
}
.after-empty-interpolation{display:block}
.unclosed-interpolation {
  width:attr(data-width #{$unit,10px);
  color:blue;
}
.after-unclosed-interpolation{display:block}
.unit-expression {
  width:attr(data-width $unit + 1px,10px);
  color:purple;
}
.after-expression{display:block}

```


